              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adada, wun jo Ci on ma wubedo i Jerucalem pe doŋ wubikok matwal. Rwot bitimowu kica ka ce owinyo kokowu; ka owinyo ci en bigamo dogwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bed Rwot omi wucam kwon me aroma, ki dokomi wumat pii me can, ento Lapwonywu pe dok bikanne, wubibedo ka neno Lapwonywu ki waŋwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce onoŋo wuŋak woko, ci wubiwinyo lok ma a ki yo tuŋ ŋewu, kun waco ni, “Yo ene, wulubi,” ka wulokke yo tuŋ lacuc nyo yo tuŋ lacam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok wubicako balo cal jogiwu ma gipayo apaya ma wudeyo komgi ki ryal, kacel ki calwu ma giliyo aliya, ma wudeyo komgi ki jabu, wubibologi woko calo gubedo gin me kwer, kun wuwaco ni, “Wudirre cen!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot bimiyo kot cwer botwu pi kodi ma doŋ wucoyo i potti ki pi cam ma tye ka cek i potti, bimiyo camwu cek maber dok mabup twatwal. I kare meno dyaŋiwu bibedo ka cam i bar olet malac; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci bimiyo twoniwu ki kanawu ma gipuro bicamo cam ma girubo ki kado, ma gipyeto woko ki odero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulu me pii ma mol bibedo tye i wi godi ducu ki i wi cere ducu, i nino ma gibineko iye dano matek i kare ma gedo mogo ma ocudo malo likuŋ bimuk poto woko piny., ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene dwe biryeny maleŋ twatwal kun caro piny calo ceŋ maryeny, ento ceŋ bibedo ma rom meno tyen abiro, i nino ma Rwot bitweyo iye waŋ ret pa jone, ki caŋo waŋ bur ma en kikome aye oketo rette i kom jone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubibedo ka wero we i macalo wuwero i dyewor me kwero nino madit pa Rwot; cwinywu bene bibedo yom calo ŋat ma woto kun dano tye ka kuto nyamulere, me cito i wi got pa Rwot, bot ŋat ma obedo Got pa jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot bilok ci miyo dwane me deyo winnye, dok bene bimiyo bade nen ma en oryeyo okemo piny, kun tye ki akemo mo madit ma pe wacce, ki leb mac ma waŋo piny woko ducu, kacel ki kot ma mwoc kun cwer corre piny ki pee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lworo madit mada bimako jo Aciria, ka ce guwinyo dwan Rwot, kun en goyogi ki odoone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goco acel acel ma en goyogi kwede ki odoo ma Rwot biketo i komgi bimalle ki koko ajaa ki opuk; en bilwenyo kwedgi kun yeŋo bade pi lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ka wanoŋe doŋ gityeko yubone woko wa con; ada, doŋ gityeko yubone woko pi kabaka, kabedone giyubo matut dok malac twatwal, ma mac ki yen bene tye madwoŋ ata, yamo dog Rwot katti calo gweŋ ma giliyo woko i mac, en aye calfa, ma bimoko mac iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
